WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:11.479
In tutorial 3.3, you'll set your style
guide, so every page sounds like you.

00:00:12.478 --> 00:00:15.853
First, open Author and
profile in Website settings,

00:00:15.903 --> 00:00:17.793
and scroll down to How you write.

00:00:19.999 --> 00:00:24.248
Not sure where to start? How to fill this
in walks you through it, step by step.

00:00:26.482 --> 00:00:29.992
Next, type your brand name
exactly as it must appear.

00:00:30.042 --> 00:00:33.645
Then add the wrong spellings
people use, so they get corrected.

00:00:35.453 --> 00:00:39.688
Then choose British or American
spelling, or leave Follow the market,

00:00:39.738 --> 00:00:42.688
so each page matches
the country it targets.

00:00:42.738 --> 00:00:45.042
Below it, say how you want to sound.

00:00:46.041 --> 00:00:48.441
Now list the words that must never appear,

00:00:48.491 --> 00:00:51.292
and add any other rules
every page must follow.

00:00:55.062 --> 00:00:57.176
Finally, click Save profile.

00:01:00.016 --> 00:01:03.091
From then on, every page
is written in your style.

00:01:03.141 --> 00:01:06.116
Your name is corrected
if a draft gets it wrong,

00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:09.879
and anything else that breaks your
rules is pointed out next to the page.

00:01:10.874 --> 00:01:15.264
So, open How you write, set your brand
spelling, choose spelling and tone,

00:01:15.314 --> 00:01:18.064
list words to avoid,
and click Save profile.

00:01:19.057 --> 00:01:21.602
Your style guide is set. Next,

00:01:21.652 --> 00:01:25.512
turn a client result into a
case study in tutorial 3.4.
